OVERVIEW: Custom-firmware install (host-mount; VM must be off; re-execs sudo)

USAGE: vphone-cli cfw <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  install                 Install CFW into a VM bundle via host mount
  update-environment      Check, or replace on a stopped VM, the guest
                          environment libraries (offline_update only)

  See 'vphone-cli help cfw <subcommand>' for detailed help.
